{"5062020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"House of the Lost: Revived","steam_appid":5062020,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your sister has disappeared into the House of the Lost, and only you can save her. Grab your slingshot and step inside, you're in for the fight of your life.<\/i><br><br><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of the Lost: Revived<\/strong> is a top-down, action roguelike that blends the chaotic fun of The Binding of Isaac with the dungeon-crawling charm of classic Zelda. Every run generates a  new haunted house full of fresh layouts, deadly enemies, and unexpected challenges for you to face alone, or in co-op.   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New House Every Run<\/strong>  <br>No two runs are the same. Layouts, enemies, and challenges reshuffle every time you play, and the House tests you at every turn. Learn its rules, exploit its habits, and pray the next door isn't hiding something worse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Tools of Destruction<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival takes firepower. Combine the weapons and items you find to craft crazy new instruments of mayhem, and discover the combinations that turn a doomed run into a legendary one. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face What Waits Below<\/strong> <br>The zombies and monsters that haunt these halls are deadly enough, but nothing can prepare you for what's waiting at the end of each floor. Four distinct environments hide within the House, each with its own enemies, its own hazards, and its own boss standing between you and your sister. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a Friend in Local Co-Op<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the House alone. Call a friend and settle in on the couch so you can tackle this challenge together. Watch out though, the House gets even tougher when there are two of you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong><\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><strong>Secrets Galore<\/strong> <br>Walk through walls, track down clues, and unlock the secrets of the House. Hidden rooms, cryptic hints, and buried treasures reward the curious, and may be your only chance at survival. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Plays Great on Deck<\/strong><br>With a Steam Deck you can take the House anywhere. Everything works great from the first launch, and it feels like House of the Lost and the Steam Deck were made for each other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/10695d8692aa18c40dbdf8b8c8a10159.avif?t=1793732812\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras_big\/10695d8692aa18c40dbdf8b8c8a10159.avif?t=1793732812 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><br><strong>The House Is Open<\/strong> <br>Race the clock on the leaderboards, hunt down every achievement, and uncover everything the House is hiding. Only one question remains: do you have what it takes to conquer the House of the Lost?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/80c780afc4ad75442f3d4e099d18e363.avif?t=1793732812\" width=768 height=768 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your sister has disappeared into the House of the Lost, and only you can save her. Grab your slingshot and step inside, you're in for the fight of your life.<\/i><br><br><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House of the Lost: Revived<\/strong> is a top-down, action roguelike that blends the chaotic fun of The Binding of Isaac with the dungeon-crawling charm of classic Zelda. Every run generates a  new haunted house full of fresh layouts, deadly enemies, and unexpected challenges for you to face alone, or in co-op.   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/08d241785ef8d2c48ee57ebf05baecbd.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New House Every Run<\/strong>  <br>No two runs are the same. Layouts, enemies, and challenges reshuffle every time you play, and the House tests you at every turn. Learn its rules, exploit its habits, and pray the next door isn't hiding something worse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/f5c653e7b3b39bb756b466f008e07ff6.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Tools of Destruction<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival takes firepower. Combine the weapons and items you find to craft crazy new instruments of mayhem, and discover the combinations that turn a doomed run into a legendary one. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/cbaaf3869feee8850618894b3bdc708f.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face What Waits Below<\/strong> <br>The zombies and monsters that haunt these halls are deadly enough, but nothing can prepare you for what's waiting at the end of each floor. Four distinct environments hide within the House, each with its own enemies, its own hazards, and its own boss standing between you and your sister. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/07ae11dc283565ee3f88c0b0cf7ea595.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a Friend in Local Co-Op<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the House alone. Call a friend and settle in on the couch so you can tackle this challenge together. Watch out though, the House gets even tougher when there are two of you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/e122a62db454f0d94f5cf67a63fd29c4.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong><\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><strong>Secrets Galore<\/strong> <br>Walk through walls, track down clues, and unlock the secrets of the House. Hidden rooms, cryptic hints, and buried treasures reward the curious, and may be your only chance at survival. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.poster.avif?t=1793732812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.webm?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/0b9f2eb0d4ab6b13ca3fb4382f5ada28.mp4?t=1793732812\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Plays Great on Deck<\/strong><br>With a Steam Deck you can take the House anywhere. Everything works great from the first launch, and it feels like House of the Lost and the Steam Deck were made for each other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/10695d8692aa18c40dbdf8b8c8a10159.avif?t=1793732812\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras_big\/10695d8692aa18c40dbdf8b8c8a10159.avif?t=1793732812 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><br><strong>The House Is Open<\/strong> <br>Race the clock on the leaderboards, hunt down every achievement, and uncover everything the House is hiding. Only one question remains: do you have what it takes to conquer the House of the Lost?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/extras\/80c780afc4ad75442f3d4e099d18e363.avif?t=1793732812\" width=768 height=768 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"House of the Lost: Revived is a top-down action roguelike built for players who grew up clearing rooms, dodging traps, and learning from every death. Each run is a new house, a new build, and a new chance to craft absurd weapons and get a little further before the House gets you.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/13c4b6946942430fdf840f0ec72151c9743d3525\/header.jpg?t=1793732812","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/0d71ea85f0d9f6a16035607de249d8f5c4d4ceaf\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793732812","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5062020\/0d71ea85f0d9f6a16035607de249d8f5c4d4ceaf\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793732812","website":"https:\/\/f5games.com\/games\/House-of-the-Lost:-Revived","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Core 2 Duo<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with OpenGL 2.1 \/ DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Keyboard or gamepad. Mouse not required.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.4 GHz Quad Core 2.0 (or higher)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any dedicated or modern integrated GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Gamepad recommended<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Core 2 Duo<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with OpenGL 2.1 \/ DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Yes<br><\/li><li><strong>Additiona